  "continuity": "All 139 domain cases pass initially. Data test compilation fails because simultaneous JUnit api.* and Assertions.* imports make assertNull ambiguous. Only the new test imports are corrected. Source review also changes the new V137 TTL constraint from a civil day to 86400 elapsed seconds and adds an actual DST-session boundary case. The second gate passes all 28 selected data tests. Other production/domain Kotlin and recovery sources remain unchanged.",
  "evidence": [
    "Three new pure policy cases cover finite counters/ownership, visibility/time/hash bounds, quiet wake state and a legally shortened head lifetime with retained in-flight lease.",
    "Fifteen new PostgreSQL cases cover exact V136-to-V137 binding retention; current root versus company/foreign-account isolation; worker-only claims and completion; duplicate/parallel callbacks; recent64 hash bounds; captured-revision acknowledgment; newer hint preservation; finite retry reset; global group capacity8; actual expired lease replacement; failed readback rollback; raw mutation/deletion denial; malformed acquired rows; parent purge; cancellation/interruption; exact elapsed TTL across DST; isolated pg_dump/pg_restore preserving pending revision/lease/encrypted capability.",
    "Eleven existing company queue cases and two native group pusher/retained LEGACY cases remain passing. Migration inputs use ordinary pre-queue device provenance, without disabling database triggers.",
    "Recovery tool accepts schema137 with the identical schema136 envelope projection and rejects unreviewed schema138. The queue introduces no encrypted envelope."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "Queue ownership and retained metadata do not grant current callback/delivery/content authority. No group callback, worker or Mobile background routing is wired in this change.",
    "No shared DI change; API/FULL worker acceptance for native pusher is recorded at 7b81b8e8. Actual group FCM/client ownership/decryption/hard-parent recovery remain required.",
    "All 54 PRD groups open; group rollout disabled. Live8b40/schema116 push on/SMTP off, normal phone28, Mobile product/hosted0b804cb2 and Starter9959c1d unchanged."
